            "notes": "Starting at round 4, pivot to the debuff damaging Biotic Orbs build.  Sell everything and buy the two debuff ability items  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) and  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505). Use damaging Biotic Orbs on cooldown.  This round is the most precarious because we do not have an easy way to replenish Biotic Energy at this point other than Biotic Grasp (secondary). Buy  [High Capacity Tubing](item_d4779a06-a19c-425d-80ff-159fde15a3f2) if you can afford it. This helps to alleviate this problem.",
