            "notes": "Continue to use damaging Biotic Orbs to debuff the enemy team on cooldown.  Sell  [High Capacity Tubing](item_d4779a06-a19c-425d-80ff-159fde15a3f2) and pick up  [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6).  Use Fade and  [Alternative Energy](item_c3e816b3-9c39-4528-9578-e3fa610b6cc6) to refill your Biotic Energy.  This allows you to almost continuously hold Biotic Grasp (primary).  Pick up common weapon items if you have additional cash or don't have enough to buy the three required items and  [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8). If you have enough cash, prioritize buying [High Capacity Tubing](item_d4779a06-a19c-425d-80ff-159fde15a3f2) again.",
